From 9673cec349e467743ec059d840c9477d38a7abae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 19:56:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] EW: reuse seeker allocations and record the timing-gate
 review

Collision-body, incarnation-key, actor-map and flight-segment reuse cut
per-frame garbage on the HOJ path. Profile receipts show p99 frames are
physical impacts, not guidance math. Commit-1 vs tip timings from this
host are checked in under docs/ew/receipts/review-*.json.

Co-authored-by: Artemis2028 <Artemis2028@users.noreply.github.com>
---
