+  PASS  S1b player ship kill still rewards and blames
+  PASS  S1c NPC-only station destruction gives no salvage
+  PASS  S1c NPC-only station destruction changes no standing or feat
+  PASS  S1d escort projectile carries creditSource playerEscort
+  PASS  S1d victim records lastDamageSource playerEscort
+  PASS  S1d escort projectile kill is credited to the player
+  PASS  S1e NPC-only clearing of Bajora sets no feat and no Cardassian standing
